        "en": "Sydney Airport (SYD)"
      },
      "guidance": {
        "en": "T8 serves the domestic and international airport stations. The station access fee is additional to the train fare and outside ordinary travel caps; Opal/contactless has a separate weekly access-fee cap. Check your exact terminal and journey."
      },
