      "destinationId": "place:Q3130",
      "title": {
        "en": "Western Sydney International (WSI)"
      },
      "guidance": {
        "en": "WSI is separate from SYD. Official guidance lists WSI Link buses via St Marys; the metro is under construction. Check airport notices and the journey planner for your dates. Do not use SYD terminal directions."
